== Usage ==
A highlighted section for explaining a difficulty classification or its wiki-specific criteria.

<pre>
{{Difficulty info section
 | title = Classification notes
 | text = Describe the classification using the wiki's documented criteria.
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* `title` — optional heading; defaults to “Difficulty information”.
* `text` — the content displayed in the section.

Copy this source into `Template:Difficulty info section` on the target wiki and test it in a sandbox.
